          "source_section": "Statement",
          "quote": "Assume $\\mathrm{AC}_\\omega$ ([[def-countable-choice]]). Every open cover of a smooth manifold has a countable cover by coordinate balls with compact closures, each closure contained in one member of the original cover.",
          "uses": [
