          "source_section": "Definition",
          "quote": "A topological space $X$ is **separable** if some at most countable subset $D\\subseteq X$ is dense in $X$ ([[def-dense-top]], [[def-countable]]). Equivalently, every nonempty open subset of $X$ meets $D$.",
