          "source_section": "Statement",
          "quote": "Let $\\mathcal A$ be a finite nonempty alphabet with $k=|\\mathcal A|\\ge1$, and let $n\\ge1$. The type classes $T_q$, $q\\in\\mathcal P_n(\\mathcal A)$, form a disjoint partition of $\\mathcal A^n$, and\n$$|\\mathcal P_n(\\mathcal A)|\\le(n+1)^{k-1}.$$",
