          "quote": "Let $\\mathcal A$ be a finite alphabet of size $k\\ge1$, let $p$ be a probability vector on $\\mathcal A$, and let $q\\in\\mathcal P_n(\\mathcal A)$. Then\n$$(n+1)^{-(k-1)}e^{-nD(q\\|p)}\\le p^{\\otimes n}(T_q)\\le e^{-nD(q\\|p)},$$\nwith $e^{-n\\cdot\\infty}:=0$ when $q$ is not supported on $p$.",
