          "quote": "For every finite full-support source, the algorithm [[alg-binary-huffman-coding]] terminates, returns a binary prefix code, and minimizes $L_p(C)$ among all binary prefix codes on the same alphabet. For a one-symbol source it returns the one-bit codeword $0$, which is optimal among codes with nonempty codewords.",
