          "claim": "By independence of the codewords, the probability that none of $M_n$ words lies in the conditional typical set is $(1-p_n(x^n))^{M_n}\\le e^{-M_np_n(x^n)}$. Choose the tolerances so that the exponent in step 2.1 leaves a positive gap below $R$; then $M_np_n(x^n)\\to\\infty$ uniformly, and the no-match probability tends to zero.",
