          "quote": "Let $R_{\\rm WZ}(D)$, $D_{\\min}$, and $D_{\\max}$ be as in [[def-it-finite-wyner-ziv-code]]. Then $D_{\\min}\\le D_{\\max}$, $R_{\\rm WZ}$ is nonincreasing and convex on $[D_{\\min},\\infty)$, $R_{\\rm WZ}(D)=0$ for $D\\ge D_{\\max}$, and $R_{\\rm WZ}$ is continuous at every feasible distortion, including $D_{\\min}$ and $D_{\\max}$.",
