          "id": "step-1-1",
          "claim": "The convolution $f_Y(y)=\\mathbb E[(2\\pi N)^{-d/2}e^{-\\|y-X\\|^2/(2N)}]$ is measurable and strictly positive. Tonelli's theorem [F3] gives integral one. Direct Gaussian integration gives $\\mathbb E\\|Z\\|^2=dN$, hence $\\mathbb E\\|Y\\|^2<\\infty$.",
