          "source": "lem-kl-invariant-under-measurable-bijections",
          "source_section": "Statement",
          "quote": "Let $\\phi:(E,\\mathcal E)\\to(F,\\mathcal F)$ be a measurable bijection with measurable inverse. For probability measures P,Q on E, let $\\phi_\\#P,\\phi_\\#Q$ be their push-forwards. Then\n$$D(\\phi_\\#P\\|\\phi_\\#Q)=D(P\\|Q).$$",
          "uses": [
