          "claim": "If $P_U(u)W(y\\mid u)>0$, then $P_Y(y)\\ge P_U(u)W(y\\mid u)>0$. Hence every displayed logarithm is finite; because the joint support is finite, $J$ is bounded and $B<\\infty$. The unmarked logarithm uses nats by [F3].",
