          "quote": "For finite $X,Y,Z$ with a joint pmf,\n\n$$H(X,Y|Z)=H(X|Z)+H(Y|X,Z),$$\n\nand\n\n$$I(X;Y,Z)=I(X;Z)+I(X;Y|Z).$$\n\nIn particular, $I(X;Y)=H(X)-H(X|Y)=H(Y)-H(Y|X)$. All terms are finite.",
