          "source": "lem-it-quantum-relative-entropy-isometric-invariance",
          "source_section": "Statement",
          "quote": "Let $V:H\\to K$ be a linear map between finite-dimensional complex inner-product spaces satisfying $V^*V=I_H$, and let $A,B$ be non-negative on $H$. Then\n\n$$D(VAV^*\\|VBV^*)=D(A\\|B).$$",
