          "source": "thm-it-quantum-relative-entropy-partial-trace-data-processing",
          "source_section": "Statement",
          "quote": "Let $H_A,H_B$ be nonzero finite-dimensional complex inner-product spaces, let $d=\\dim H_B\\ge1$, and let $A,B$ be non-negative operators on $H_A\\otimes H_B$. Then\n\n$$D(\\operatorname{Tr}_B A\\|\\operatorname{Tr}_B B)\\le D(A\\|B).$$",
          "uses": [
