          "id": "step-1-1",
          "claim": "In either sector write $B_1=\\operatorname{diag}(x,y)$ and $B_2=FB_1F$. The F matrices in [F1] and [F2] are unitary by their displayed entries and the identities proved for the respective examples. Since $x,y$ are unit complex numbers, $B_1$ is unitary; $B_2$ is a product of unitary matrices and is therefore unitary as well.",
