          "source": "lem-qc-tqc-toric-check-commutation",
          "source_section": "Statement",
          "quote": "All star and plaquette checks of [[def-qc-tqc-toric-checks]] commute. The\nproduct of all stars is the identity, and the product of all plaquettes is\nthe identity.",
