          "quote": "Let $H$ be a finite-dimensional complex inner-product space and let $u,v\\in H$ be unit vectors. Write $P_u=|u\\rangle\\langle u|$ and $P_v=|v\\rangle\\langle v|$ using the Dirac convention of [[def-qc-dirac-notation-conversion]], and define their trace distance by $D(P_u,P_v):=\\tfrac12\\|P_u-P_v\\|_1$, where $\\|\\cdot\\|_1$ is the trace norm of [[def-qc-trace-norm]]. Then\n$$D(P_u,P_v)\\le \\|u-v\\|.$$",
