ided parametrices **modulo compact operators**:\n$$PB=I-\\lambda B\\quad\\hbox{on }L^2,\\qquad BP=I-\\lambda B\\quad\\hbox{on }H^2.$$\nHere on the second space $B$ denotes its restriction after inclusion $H^2\\hookrightarrow L^2$; it is compact on $H^2$. No assertion concerning arbitrary-order elliptic operators, or pseudodifferential symbol classes, is part of this theorem.",
