          "source_section": "Statement",
          "quote": "Use [[def-coefficient-complete-codifferential-deformation]]. For every fixed degree $d$, the order filtration on $E^d$ is separated and complete, with $E^d\\cong\\varprojlim_n E^d/(F^nE)^d$; thus $E$ is complete as a graded algebra in the degreewise sense, with $F^pE\\,F^qE\\subseteq F^{p+q}E$. The coderivations form a closed graded Lie subalgebra for\n\n$$[P,Q]=PQ-(-1)^{|P||Q|}QP.$$\n\nWith $dT=[D,T]$, the positive-order space $\\mathfrak g=F^1\\mathfrak l$ is a complete filtered differential graded Lie algebra in this degreewise sense, with $F^p\\mathfrak g=F^p\\mathfrak l$ for $p\\ge1$, $d(F^p\\mathfrak g)\\subseteq F^p\\mathfrak g$, and $[F^p\\mathfrak g,F^q\\mathfrak g]\\subseteq F^{p+q}\\mathfrak g$.",
