          "quote": "For $a\\ge0$, the Brauer algebra $B_a(\\delta)$ over any commutative unital ring $R$ is free of rank $(2a-1)!!$, with $(-1)!!=1$. The partition algebra $P_a(\\delta)$ is free of rank $\\operatorname{Bell}(2a)$, where $\\operatorname{Bell}(j)$ denotes the number of set partitions of a $j$-element set.",
