          "id": "derive-6-1",
          "claim": "We give the required algebraic reductions before using tangle independence. For adjacent $i,j$, the defining relations and snake relation give $g_je_ig_j=g_i^{-1}e_jg_i^{-1}$: first $g_je_i=g_i^{-1}e_je_i$, and $e_je_ig_j=e_je_ie_jg_i^{-1}=e_jg_i^{-1}$. They also give $g_je_ie_j=g_i^{-1}e_j$ and its word reversal $e_je_ig_j=e_jg_i^{-1}$, by multiplying $g_ig_je_i=e_je_i$ on the right by $e_j$ and using $e_je_ie_j=e_j$. These are identities in the presentation, not consequences pulled back from diagrams. Finally $g_i^2=1+sg_i-s\\lambda^{-1}e_i$, and $g_i^{-1}=g_i-s+se_i$.",
