          "claim": "We prove this sum equals $I_n^{(r)}$. First $W_j$ modulo its cup ideal is spanned by its positive permutation lifts: multiplication by $g_i$ increases length, giving $g_{s_i\\pi}$, or decreases length and the quadratic identity of step 6.1 expresses the product using $g_{s_i\\pi}$, $g_\\pi$ and a cup-ideal term. Thus $W_r=V_r^{(r)}+W_re_1W_r$. Tensoring its cup ideal with $I_{2k}^{(0)}$ lands in $I_n^{(r-2)}$, because its generator is $e_1e_3\\cdots e_{2k+1}$. It follows that $I_{2k}^{(0)}\\otimes W_r\\subset I_n^{(r-2)}+V_n^{(r)}$. By length-additive block/shuffle factorization of positive permutation braids, the same containment holds after multiplying on either side by arbitrary positive permutation lifts: their block factors are absorbed in the two-sided ideal $I_{2k}^{(0)}$ and the algebra $W_r$.",
