          "quote": "For $R$, $\\delta$, $n$, $t$ and $W_{n,t}(R,\\delta)$ as in [[def-temperley-lieb-link-state-standard-modules]], the rule $x\\cdot a=[x\\circ a]$ defines a unital right $\\mathrm{TL}_n(R,\\delta)$-module structure on $W_{n,t}(R,\\delta)$.",
