          "quote": "Fix a finite-dimensional complex semisimple Lie algebra $\\mathfrak g$, a Cartan subalgebra $\\mathfrak h$, and a positive Borel $\\mathfrak b=\\mathfrak h\\oplus\\mathfrak n^+$. Write $Q^+=\\sum_i\\mathbb Z_{\\geq0}\\alpha_i$, $\\mu\\leq\\lambda$ when $\\lambda-\\mu\\in Q^+$, and $w\\cdot\\lambda=w(\\lambda+\\rho)-\\rho$.\n\nEvery Verma module $M(\\lambda)$, every quotient of it, and every finite-dimensional $\\mathfrak h$-semisimple $\\mathfrak g$-module belongs to $\\mathcal O$.",
