          "source": "lem-pa36-flag-tdo-pbw-and-twist",
          "source_section": "Statement",
          "quote": "Use $X$, $\\mathfrak g$, $\\mathfrak b_X$, and $\\mathcal D_\\kappa$ from\n[[def-pa36-flag-tdo-and-module]]. For every $\\kappa\\in\\mathfrak h^*$ the\nisotropy relations generate a two-sided ideal and define a TDO satisfying\n$$F_0\\mathcal D_\\kappa=\\mathcal O_X,\\qquad \\operatorname{gr}\\mathcal D_\\kappa\\cong\\operatorname{Sym}_{\\mathcal O_X}T_X.$$\nIf $\\eta\\in X^*(T)$ is integral, then\n$$\\mathcal D_\\kappa\\cong\\operatorname{Diff}\\bigl(\\mathcal O_X(\\kappa+\\rho)\\bigr) \\quad(\\kappa+\\rho\\text{ integral}),\\qquad \\mathcal D_{-\\rho}=\\operatorname{Diff}(\\mathcal O_X),$$\nand tensoring by $\\mathcal O_X(\\eta)$ defines an equivalence between left\n$\\mathcal D_\\kappa$-modules and left $\\mathcal D_{\\kappa+\\eta}$-modules.",
          "uses": [
            "2.1",
            "3.3"
          ]
