          "quote": "Assume the complex flag-variety setup, including the Axiom of Choice, of\n[[def-pa36-flag-tdo-and-module]]. Let $\\kappa$ be antidominant, put\n$$\\Phi_\\kappa=\\{\\beta\\in\\Phi:\\langle\\kappa,\\beta^\\vee\\rangle=0\\}, \\qquad J=\\Delta\\cap\\Phi_\\kappa,$$\nand assume $J$ is a simple system for the full zero-root subsystem\n$\\Phi_\\kappa$. Choose a reduced expression\n$w_J=s_{\\alpha_N}\\cdots s_{\\alpha_1}$ for the longest element of $W_J$.\nSet $\\mu_0=\\rho$, $\\mu_j=s_{\\alpha_j}\\mu_{j-1}$, and\n$$H_j=M(-\\kappa-\\rho+\\mu_j),\\qquad \\mathcal E_j=\\mathsf E^B_{\\kappa+\\rho}(H_j),$$\nusing the exact twisted associated-bundle functor in\n[[lem-pa36-twisted-associated-bundle-and-parabolic-descent]]. The rational\n$B$-action has highest-vector weight $\\mu_j$. Then there are embeddings\n$$H_N\\subseteq\\cdots\\subseteq H_0,\\qquad \\mathcal E_N\\subseteq\\cdots\\subseteq\\mathcal E_0 =\\mathcal D_\\kappa\\otimes_{\\mathcal O_X}\\mathcal O_X(\\rho).$$\nFor each $j$, a coherent module $N_j$ over\n$\\mathcal D^{\\alpha_j}_{\\kappa-\\rho}$ satisfies\n$$\\mathcal E_{j-1}/\\mathcal E_j\\cong \\mathcal O_X(\\rho)\\otimes p_{\\alpha_j}^\\dagger N_j.$$\nFurthermore $\\mathcal E_N$ is generated as a $\\mathcal D_\\kappa$-module by\nfinitely many global sections: for a finite-dimensional rational irreducible\n$G$-module $V$ of highest weight $\\rho$ there is a surjection\n$$\\mathcal D_\\kappa\\otimes_{\\mathbb C}V\\twoheadrightarrow\\mathcal E_N,$$\nwith horizontal constant $V$-factor. The sequence of roots depends only on\nthe chosen reduced expression in $W_J$, not on any later module to which\nthe chain is applied. When $J$ is empty, $N=0$ and the same assertions hold\nwith $H_N=H_0$.",
