          "quote": "Assume the Axiom of Choice. Let $G$ be the connected simply connected complex\nsemisimple affine algebraic group with maximal torus $T$, root system $\\Phi$,\nsimple roots $\\Delta$ and positive system $\\Phi^+$ of\n[[def-complex-semisimple-algebraic-group-borel-and-flag-variety]], and let\n$B=T\\ltimes U$ be its Borel subgroup as in\n[[lem-semisimple-borel-root-factorization]]. Fix a simple root\n$\\alpha\\in\\Delta$, let $U_{-\\alpha}$ be the negative root subgroup, let\n$\\varphi_\\alpha:SL_2(\\mathbb C)\\to G$ and\n$n_\\alpha=\\varphi_\\alpha(w)$ be the rank-one homomorphism and Weyl\nrepresentative of [[lem-semisimple-rank-one-sl2-root-homomorphism]], and let\n$P_\\alpha$ be the subgroup generated by $B$ and $U_{-\\alpha}$. Then:\n\n(i) $P_\\alpha$ is a closed connected algebraic subgroup of $G$ with\n$$P_\\alpha=B\\sqcup Bn_\\alpha B,$$\nthe two double cosets being disjoint;\n\n(ii) $\\operatorname{Lie}P_\\alpha=\\mathfrak b\\oplus\\mathfrak g_{-\\alpha}$ and\n$\\dim P_\\alpha=\\dim B+1$;\n\n(iii) the coset space $P_\\alpha/B$ is $\\mathbb P^1$: it is covered by the two\naffine charts $z\\mapsto u_{-\\alpha}(z)B$ and $t\\mapsto u_\\alpha(t)n_\\alpha B$,\neach isomorphic to $\\mathbb A^1$ and glued by $t=z^{-1}$.",
