          "quote": "Fix a symmetrizable Cartan datum $(I,A,D,P,P^{\\vee},q)$, an index $i\\in I$, and put $q_i=q^{d_i}$. Let $U_q(\\mathfrak g)$ be the Drinfeld–Jimbo algebra and let $A_i$ be the subalgebra generated by $E_i,F_i,K_i^{\\pm1}$ ([[def-drinfeld-jimbo-quantized-enveloping-algebra]], [[def-positive-negative-and-toral-quantum-subalgebras]]); write $x^{(m)}:=x^m/[m]_i!$ for the divided powers of [[def-quantum-integers-factorials-and-divided-powers-at-q-i]].\n\n(i) The assignment $e\\mapsto E_i$, $f\\mapsto F_i$, $k\\mapsto K_i$, $k^{-1}\\mapsto K_i^{-1}$ defines an algebra isomorphism from the standard rank-one algebra $\\mathbb A$ over $\\mathbb Q(q)$, presented by $e,f,k^{\\pm1}$ with $kek^{-1}=q_i^2e$, $kfk^{-1}=q_i^{-2}f$ and $[e,f]=(k-k^{-1})/(q_i-q_i^{-1})$ onto $A_i$; the images of the monomials $F_i^aK_i^mE_i^b$ ($a,b\\ge0$, $m\\in\\mathbb Z$) are linearly independent in $U_q(\\mathfrak g)$, being images of the PBW monomials of the triangular decomposition ([[thm-triangular-decomposition-of-a-quantized-enveloping-algebra]]).\n\n(ii) For all $a,b\\ge0$, $K_iE_i^{(a)}K_i^{-1}=q_i^{2a}E_i^{(a)}$ and $K_iF_i^{(b)}K_i^{-1}=q_i^{-2b}F_i^{(b)}$, and for $b\\ge1$ the divided powers satisfy the exact commutation formula\n$$E_iF_i^{(b)}=F_i^{(b)}E_i+\\frac{F_i^{(b-1)}}{q_i^{b}-q_i^{-b}}\\sum_{s=0}^{b-1}\\bigl(q_i^{-2s}K_i-q_i^{2s}K_i^{-1}\\bigr);$$\niterating it computes $E_i^{(a)}F_i^{(b)}$ as a finite sum of monomials $F_i^{(b-t)}K_i^{m}E_i^{(a-t)}$ ($0\\le t\\le\\min(a,b)$) with coefficients in $\\mathbb Q(q)$.\n\n(iii) For every $N\\ge0$ there is a simple $A_i$-module $L_i(N)$ of dimension $N+1$: it is the quotient of the cyclic module $\\widetilde M(N):=A_i/\\bigl(A_iE_i+A_i(K_i-q_i^N)\\bigr)$ by the submodule generated by $F_i^{(N+1)}w_N$, where $w_N$ is the image of $1$, with basis the images $v_t$ of $F_i^{(t)}w_N$, $0\\le t\\le N$, on which $K_iv_t=q_i^{N-2t}v_t$, $F_iv_t=[t+1]_iv_{t+1}$ and $E_iv_t=[N-t+1]_iv_{t-1}$ (with $v_{-1}=v_{N+1}=0$); $L_i(N)$ is the unique simple $A_i$-module generated by a vector $v\\ne0$ with $E_iv=0$, $K_iv=q_i^Nv$ and $F_i^{N+1}v=0$.",
