          "quote": "Let $(I,A,D,P,P^{\\vee},q)$ be a finite symmetrizable Cartan datum\n([[def-symmetrizable-cartan-datum-for-a-quantum-group]]), put\n$A=\\mathbb Z[q,q^{-1}]$ ([[def-the-laurent-polynomial-ring]]), let\n$L:=\\sum_{i\\in I}\\mathbb Z(d_ih_i)\\subseteq P^{\\vee}$, and let $U_A^0$ be the\n$A$-subalgebra of $U_q^0$ generated by the $K_h^{\\pm1}$ and the toral quantum\nbinomials $T_{i,c,t}$ ([[def-lusztig-divided-power-integral-form]]).\n\n(a) **One simple torus.** Fix $i\\in I$ and write $z:=q_i$, $K:=K_i$,\n$T_t:=T_{i,0,t}$ for $t\\ge0$. Then for all $r,s\\ge0$, $c\\in\\mathbb Z$ and\n$t\\ge1$,\n$$T_rT_s=\\sum_{j=0}^{\\min(r,s)}z^{rs}K^{-j}\\binom{r+s-j}{r}_z\\binom{r}{j}_zT_{r+s-j},\\qquad T_{c+1,t}=z^tT_{c,t}+K^{-1}z^{-c+t-1}T_{c,t-1},$$\nwhere $\\binom{m}{r}_z$ is the Gaussian binomial of\n[[def-quantum-integers-factorials-and-divided-powers-at-q-i]]; all\ncoefficients lie in $A$. Moreover the $A$-subalgebra of $U_q^0$ generated by\n$K^{\\pm1}$ and all $T_{c,t}$ equals the $A$-span of\n$\\{K^{\\delta}T_t:\\delta\\in\\{0,1\\},\\,t\\ge0\\}$, and that set is an $A$-basis.\n\n(b) **Full torus.** Fix a $\\mathbb Z$-basis of $P^{\\vee}$, let $J$ be the\nfinite set of coordinates occurring in the finitely many vectors $d_ih_i$, and\nlet $D:=\\bigoplus_{j\\in J}\\mathbb Z e_j$ be the corresponding coordinate direct\nsummand. For every coset of $L$ in $P^{\\vee}$ choose the representative $c$\nwhose $D$-component has minimal sum of coordinate absolute values, ties broken\nlexicographically, and whose complementary component is the coset's common\ncomplementary component. Then\n$$U_A^0=\\bigoplus_{c}K_c\\cdot A\\text{-span}\\Bigl\\{\\prod_{i\\in I}K_i^{\\delta_i}T_{i,0,t_i}:\\delta_i\\in\\{0,1\\},\\,t_i\\ge0\\Bigr\\},$$\nthe sum over the chosen representatives, so the displayed elements form an\n$A$-basis of $U_A^0$.\n\nBoth statements are proved directly on the unmodified generators over the\nnon-PID ring $A$: no integral PBW or canonical-basis input, no inference from\ntorsion-freeness to freeness, and no modified-${}_A\\dot U$ result is used.",
