          "id": "step-1-1",
          "step": "1.1",
          "claim": "Fix $w\\in W$. By [F3], its strict lower interval $\\{y:y<w\\}$ is finite and consists only of shorter elements, so construct $C_y$ for those $y$ by induction on length. Their triangular expansions show that the $C_y$ form an $A$-basis of $V_{<w}:=\\operatorname{span}_A\\{T_y:y<w\\}$: the transition matrix is finite, unitriangular, and ordered by length.",
