          "quote": "Assume the Axiom of Countable Choice $\\mathrm{AC}_\\omega$ of\n[[def-countable-choice]]. Then the field $\\mathbb Q_p$ is locally compact and totally disconnected. In\nparticular, $\\mathbb Z_p$ is a compact open subring.",
