          "source": "thm-rational-cherednik-standard-module-lies-in-category-o",
          "source_section": "Statement",
          "quote": "For every finite-dimensional $W$-module $E$, the standard module $\\Delta_c(E)$ of [[def-rational-cherednik-standard-module]] belongs to category O of [[def-rational-cherednik-category-o]].",
          "uses": [
