        },
        {
          "fact": "F5",
          "source": "lem-rational-cherednik-polynomial-representation-dunkl-formula",
          "source_section": "Statement",
          "quote": "For $t=1$, the polynomial representation of [[def-rational-cherednik-polynomial-representation]] has the differential-reflection action\n$$x f=xf,\\qquad (w f)(z)=f(w^{-1}z),\\qquad y f=\\partial_y f-\\sum_{s\\in S}c_s\\frac{\\alpha_s(y)}{\\alpha_s}(1-s)f.$$\nEach displayed operator maps $\\mathbb C[\\mathfrak h^*]$ to itself and these operators satisfy the presentation of [[def-rational-cherednik-algebra]].",
