          "quote": "For every finite complex reflection group and every parameter, rational Cherednik category $\\mathcal O_c$ has a finite projective generator which is a direct summand of a generalized standard $G_{n,c}=H_{1,c}\\otimes_{S(\\mathfrak h)\\rtimes\\mathbb CW}(\\mathbb CW\\otimes S(\\mathfrak h)/S(\\mathfrak h)_{>n})$ for sufficiently large $n$. It is equivalent to finite-dimensional modules over a finite-dimensional algebra. Every indecomposable projective cover $P(E)$ of the simple head $L(E)$ has a standard filtration and an exact sequence $0\\to K(E)\\to P(E)\\to\\Delta(E)\\to0$, where the standard labels $F$ in $K(E)$ satisfy $a_E-a_F\\in\\mathbb Z_{>0}$. The standard labels give a finite highest-weight structure for $E<F$ when $a_E-a_F\\in\\mathbb Z_{>0}$.",
