          "source_section": "Statement",
          "quote": "Assume the Axiom of Choice ([[def-axiom-of-choice]]). If $G$ is a locally\ncompact Hausdorff abelian group ([[def-locally-compact-space]]), then\n$\\widehat G$ is a locally compact Hausdorff abelian topological group, and the\nsets $\\{\\gamma:\\gamma[K]\\subseteq V\\}$ with $K\\subseteq G$ compact and\n$V\\subseteq\\mathbb T$ open with $1\\in V$ form a basis of neighbourhoods of the identity\ncharacter ([[def-neighbourhood-top]]).",
