          "quote": "Assume AC. For every field $k$, every space $X$, and $n\\ge0$, evaluation gives a natural $k$-linear isomorphism\n$$H^n(X;k)\\xrightarrow{\\ \\sim\\ }\\operatorname{Hom}_k(H_n(X;k),k).$$\nThere is no finite-dimensional hypothesis. The right side is the full algebraic dual.",
