\\Sigma_{\\rm cut};\\vec W,i,i^*).$$\n\nThe sewing map from right to left is the actual normalized tube map; its inverse is the complete composition-dual cutting resolution. Both separating and nonseparating cuts, all multiplicities, commuting disjoint cuts and iterated gluing are included. Markings, tensor order and the Lagrangian identifications of the cut are retained; a change of parametrization is represented by its weighted mapping cylinder.",
