          "id": "step-1-1",
          "claim": "Applying quaternion conjugation twice gives $\\overline{\\overline{(a,b)}}=(\\bar{\\bar a},b)=(a,b)$. Also $(a,b)+\\overline{(a,b)}=(a+\\bar a,0)=(\\widehat{2a_0},0)$ by [F2].",
