          "quote": "If $B=(b_1,\\ldots,b_n)$ is a basis of a finite-dimensional $F$-vector space $V$, then its dual family $B^*=(b_1^*,\\ldots,b_n^*)$ is a basis of $V^*$. Consequently $\\dim V^*=\\dim V=n$.",
